# Maven Wrapper (backend/mvnw, backend/mvnw.cmd, backend/.mvn/wrapper/) is
# intentionally NOT ignored -- it must be committed so `./mvnw` works without
# a pre-installed Maven. This wrapper (plugin 3.3.4, distributionType=only-script)
# has no maven-wrapper.jar to ignore in the first place -- mvnw downloads the
# Maven distribution directly.
